NDA, TATSUYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KINOSHITA, KOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MOROSHIMA, TADASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGASHIMA, NOBUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKA, YASUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UEDA, YASUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANAGIDA, YOSHIFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An industrially advantageous process for preparing high-purity 3-hydroxytetrahydrofuran easily and simply, which comprises converting a 4-halo-3-hydroxybutyric acid ester into a 4-halo-1,3-butanediol by reducing the ester with a boron hydride compound and/or an aluminum hydride compound in an organic solvent incompatible with water and treating the obtained reaction mixture with an acid and water, recovering an aqueous solution containing the diol, conducting the cyclization of the diol in this aqueous solution, extracting the resulting solution with an organic solvent incompatible with water, and isolating 3-hydroxytetrahydrofuran from the extract through concentration and/or distillation.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé, avantageux sur le plan industriel, permettant de produire, facilement et simplement, du 3-hydroxytétrahydrofurane de pureté élevée. Ce procédé comprend les opérations consistant à transformer un ester d'acide 4-halo-3-hydroxybutyrique en 4-halo-1,3-butanediol par réduction dudit ester avec un composé d'hydrure de bore et/ou un composé d'hydrure d'aluminium, dans un solvant organique non compatible avec l'eau, à traiter le mélange de réaction obtenu avec un acide et de l'eau, à récupérer une solution aqueuse contenant le diol, à effectuer la cyclisation du diol dans ladite solution aqueuse, à extraire la solution formée avec un solvant organique non compatible avec l'eau, et à isoler le 3-hydroxytétrahydrofurane de l'extrait, par concentration et/ou distillation.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>